@model myapp.Pages.PohnpeiModel

<style>
html, body {
  font-size: 12px;
} 
#pohnpei-grid h6 {
  font-weight: 500;
  font-family: "Courgette", cursive;
}  
.water-hover {
  width: 200px;
  height: 200px;
  border-radius: 15px;
  overflow: hidden;
  position: relative;
  display: inline-block;
  cursor: pointer;
} 
.water-hover img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;
  transition: transform 0.4s ease, filter 0.4s ease;
}
.water-hover:hover img {
  transform: scale(1.05);
  filter: url(#waterRipple) brightness(1.08) saturate(1.3);
}
.water-hover::before,
.water-hover::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  left: 50%;
  top: 50%;
  width: 20px;
  height: 20px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
  opacity: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
}
.water-hover::before {
  border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
}
.water-hover::after {
  border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
}
.water-hover:hover::before {
  animation: ripple 1s ease-out forwards;
}
.water-hover:hover::after {
  animation: ripple 1s ease-out 0.15s forwards;
}

@@keyframes ripple {
  0% {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    opacity: 0.6;
  }
  100% {
    width: 300px;
    height: 300px;
    opacity: 0;
  }
}

#pohnpei-grid ul li { 
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  z-index: 1;
  transition: box-shadow 0.25s ease;
}
#pohnpei-grid ul li {
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  z-index: 1;
  border-radius: 6px; 
  transition:
    transform 0.25s ease,
    box-shadow 0.25s ease,
    background-color 0.25s ease;
  display: inline-block;
  width: auto;
  max-width: 100%;
}
#pohnpei-grid ul li::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  transform: scale(1);
  transition: transform 0.25s ease, opacity 0.25s ease;
  opacity: 0;
  z-index: 0;
} 
#pohnpei-grid ul li:hover {  
  font-weight: 700; 
  transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.02);
  box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);
  z-index: 10; 
} 
#pohnpei-grid ul li:hover::before {
  transform: scale(1.05);
  opacity: 1; 
} 

@@media screen and (min-width: 1000px) { 
  #pohnpei-grid ul li:hover {
    transform: translateY(-6px) scale(1.22) !important; 
    z-index: 50 !important; 
  } 
}
</style>

<div class="page-main uk-section uk-flex uk-flex-center">
  <div class="uk-width-1-1 uk-width-3-4@m uk-text-center">

    <h6 class="page-title uk-text-bold uk-text-center uk-margin-small-bottom">
       The Secret Island of Rainforests & Reefs
    </h6>

  <div id="pohnpei-grid" class="uk-grid-divider uk-child-width-1-1@m uk-child-width-1-3@l uk-flex uk-flex-center" uk-grid> 

  <div class="uk-width-1-1">
        <h6 class="uk-text-normal uk-text-center uk-margin-xsmall-bottom">
          Pohnpei State ~ The Federated States of Micronesia
        </h6>
  </div>

    <div class="uk-text-left@s uk-text-center">
        Pohnpei is one of the most lush and enchanting islands in the Federated States of Micronesia, known for its dense emerald rainforests, dramatic mountain peaks, and vibrant coral reef ecosystems. Often called a tropical paradise of the Pacific, the island blends untouched natural beauty with rich Micronesian culture and history. From mist-covered jungles and hidden waterfalls to the legendary ruins of Nan Madol and thriving marine life in its surrounding lagoons, Pohnpei offers a rare destination where nature, mystery, and tradition exist in perfect harmony.
    </div>

