    <div>
        <ul class="uk-list uk-list-divider uk-text-bold" style="font-size: 8px;">
            <li>
            Pohnpei is home to Nan Madol, a mysterious ancient stone city built on artificial islets and often called the “Venice of the Pacific.”
            </li>
            <li>
            The island is covered in dense tropical rainforest, making it one of the wettest places on Earth with lush green landscapes year-round.
            </li>
            <li>
            Mount Nanlaud, Pohnpei’s highest peak, rises through cloud forests and offers some of the most dramatic hiking terrain in Micronesia.
            </li>
            <li>
            Pohnpei’s surrounding reefs and lagoons are rich with marine life, including coral gardens, reef fish, turtles, and excellent diving spots.
            </li>
            <li>
            Pohnpeian culture is deeply rooted in tradition, with strong community values, local customs, and a close connection to the land and ocean.
            </li>
        </ul>
        </div>

    <div class="water-hover uk-width-expand">
    <img src="~/images/pages/subpages/caption.jpg" alt="Explore Micronesia" style="width: 200px; height: 200px; border-radius: 15px;">  
    </div>

  </div>

  </div>
</div>

<svg style="display:none;">
  <filter id="waterRipple">
    <feTurbulence id="turbulence"
      type="fractalNoise"
      baseFrequency="0.008"
      numOctaves="3"
      seed="2"
      result="noise">
      <animate attributeName="baseFrequency"
               dur="4s"
               values="0.008;0.012;0.008"
               repeatCount="indefinite"/>
    </feTurbulence>

    <feDisplacementMap
      in="SourceGraphic"
      in2="noise"
      scale="0"
      xChannelSelector="R"
      yChannelSelector="G">
      <animate attributeName="scale"
               from="0"
               to="35"
               dur="0.4s"
               begin="mouseover"
               fill="freeze"/>
      <animate attributeName="scale"
               from="35"
               to="0"
               dur="0.6s"
               begin="mouseout"
               fill="freeze"/>
    </feDisplacementMap>
  </filter>
</svg>
